<article class="card" data-pf-id="{{ product.id }}"><a href="{{ product.url }}">{% if product.featured_image %}{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '300,600' }}{% endif %}<div class="meta"><h3>{{ product.title | escape }}</h3><span class="price">{{ product.price | money }}</span></div></a><p>Confirm actual product timing with the store.</p></article>